Inspect and repair the Story-scoped Git workspaces that repository-mutating
spawns run in.

Each Story gets one managed worktree under .temp/<STORY-ID>/worktree on a
short-lived task-board/story/<STORY-ID> branch forked from trunk. Trunk is
spawn.worktree_isolation.integration_base_branch when configured, and otherwise
resolves from refs/remotes/origin/HEAD and then the current branch.

These commands require a local authoritative board. On a remote board they
refuse with worktree_isolation_requires_local_board and do nothing else.

Usage:
  task-board worktree [command]

Available Commands:
  abort                 Stop using a Story workspace, preserving its work by default
  checkpoint            Commit an accepted leaf onto its Story branch while preserving integrating
  close-landed          Close an element whose accepted candidate is already on the protected trunk
  complete              Prove an accepted Story's code landed on its own repository, then record its board state in the board repository
  converge              Refresh a pinned Story workspace onto fresh trunk, carrying its uncommitted delta
  gc                    Release Story leases whose holding runs are provably terminal
  integrate             Land an accepted Story candidate on trunk and commit its board state
  integrating           Classify every element parked at integrating: awaiting a landing, board-only, already on trunk, or deferred
  invalidate-acceptance Release an invalidated or failed-revalidation acceptance back to rework
  obligations           List Change Request revisions that no live run owns
  prepare-landed-review Export a signed current-default tree for a new producer handoff and exact-tree review
  reconcile-trunk       Move the control root's trunk onto fresh protected authority when every local commit is already delivered there
  refresh-candidate     Refresh an initial or rework candidate base without losing uncommitted files
  repair                Re-materialize a recorded workspace whose worktree is missing
  start-landed-rework   Reprove a landed-review export and durably authorize normal producer rework
  status                Report managed Story workspaces and what blocks their cleanup
  transaction           Inspect and dispose of a refused or abandoned integration transaction
  trunk-rewrite         Report and migrate Story workspaces orphaned by a rewrite of protected trunk history

